  "title": "Binary to BCD Converter (0 - 19)",
  "description": "Design a Binary to BCD converter that converts any 5-bit binary number in the range 0 to 19 into BCD. The output has a tens digit T (single bit, 0 or 1) and a 4-bit units digit U3 U2 U1 U0. Use one 7483 IC and basic gates. Hint: if the binary value is greater than 9, add 0110 (6) to the lower four bits and make T = 1. The 'greater than 9' condition is T = B4 + B3(B2 + B1).",
